# SPA fallback.
#
# The OAuth redirect URI is /auth/callback. Without this rule a static host
# returns 404 for that path, the app never loads, and the authorization code is
# never redeemed — cloud storage silently cannot be connected.
#
# 200 (rewrite), not 302: the browser must keep the /auth/callback URL and its
# ?code=… query string so the app can read them.
/*    /index.html   200
